WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.967
Ask for a two-page report from the source notes · typing 3×

00:00:05.967 --> 00:00:08.500
Send the request to CLIO

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.033
CLIO inspects the workspace · idle waits omitted

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:18.033
Allow the source-file reads

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:22.367
CLIO writes and runs the report builder · 3×

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:25.367
The report is created; CLIO prepares its preview · 2×

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:28.867
CLIO corrects the requested review page range · 2×

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:34.367
CLIO reviews the rendered pages and registers the file · 2×

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:40.733
The answer and generated files arrive · 3×

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:47.733
Open the Word file that CLIO just generated

00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:51.767
Expand its PDF preview · idle pauses omitted

00:00:51.767 --> 00:01:06.233
Briefly review both pages; download the editable Word file
